      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Speech-to-Text as the chosen external provider. The next step is to solidify how to integrate this choice into `poll_transcription.py` and the code structure. I'm exploring the best way to handle authentication and error management within the Python script.\n\n\n**Outlining the Structure**\n\nNow I have a clearer outline for `poll_transcription.py`. I'll structure it to use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text SDK, including the `SpeechClient` and `OperationsClient`. The core will be a `poll_transcription_job` function that accepts an operation name and handles polling the long-running operation. It will return the final transcript once the job completes. The code will include error handling and status checks during the polling process.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818203829,
          "start": 1789818201589
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b97a65f5001HtgMaIIxcU9qYB",
      "message_id": "msg_0b97a60e3001ErhkoxEbXTR6TJ",
      "session_id": "ses_f46859f32ffeqTxlV26WrAyaor",
      "time_created": 1789818201589,
      "time_updated": 1789818203829
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "l4jny3S2txsdeQKM",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import speech_v1p1beta1\nfrom google.api_core.operations_v1 import OperationsClient\nfrom google.api_core.client_options import ClientOptions\n\ndef poll_transcription_job(operation_name: str):\n    \"\"\"Polls a Google Cloud Speech-to-Text transcription job and returns the transcript.\n\n    Args:\n        operation_name: The name of the long-running operation to poll.\n    \n    Returns:\n        The transcribed text if the operation is complete, otherwise None.\n    \"\"\"\n    client_options = ClientOptions(api_endpoint=\"speech.googleapis.com\")\n    operations_client = OperationsClient(client_options=client_options)\n\n    operation = operations_client.get_operation(name=operation_name)\n\n    if operation.done:\n        response = speech_v1p1beta1.LongRunningRecognizeResponse(operation.response)\n        transcript_builder = []\n        for result in response.results:\n            transcript_builder.append(result.alternatives[0].transcript)\n        return \" \".join(transcript_builder)\n    else:\n        return None\n\n",
            "filePath": "poll_transcription.py"
          },
