      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Transcription Script**\n\nI'm currently focused on the `submit_transcription.py` script. The key is to select a concrete speech-to-text provider, and I've decided to go with Google Cloud Speech-to-Text. I need to integrate this provider's API into the Python file to handle the audio submission.\n\n\n**Outlining the Python Script**\n\nI've sketched out the initial structure for `submit_transcription.py`. I'm starting by importing the necessary Google Cloud Speech libraries. The plan is to create a function that handles the batch transcription submission. This function will leverage the `google-cloud-speech` library, using client and model identifiers. I'm assuming that the audio files will be stored in Google Cloud Storage. Now I need to flesh out the function details.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789818197793,
          "start": 1789818195201
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b97a4d01001zCZR3vbPUsCSe8",
      "message_id": "msg_0b97a47ee001DkFFY0kaXSsW76",
      "session_id": "ses_f4685b8a0ffei91zTo79eFEkPa",
      "time_created": 1789818195201,
      "time_updated": 1789818197794
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "i3ZCZTNtKeSj02nO",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import speech_v1p1beta1 as speech\nfrom google.cloud.speech_v1p1beta1 import enums\n\ndef submit_transcription_job(gcs_uri: str, language_code: str = \"en-US\"):\n    \"\"\"Submits an audio file for batch transcription using Google Cloud Speech-to-Text.\n\n    Args:\n        gcs_uri: The Google Cloud Storage URI of the audio file (e.g., \"gs://cloud-samples-data/speech/brooklyn_bridge.flac\").\n        language_code: The language of the audio file (e.g., \"en-US\").\n\n    Returns:\n        The operation name of the long-running transcription job.\n    \"\"\"\n    client = speech.SpeechClient()\n\n    audio = speech.RecognitionAudio(uri=gcs_uri)\n    config = speech.RecognitionConfig(\n        encoding=enums.RecognitionConfig.AudioEncoding.FLAC,\n        sample_rate_hertz=16000,\n        language_code=language_code,\n        # Use a specific model for better accuracy or speed\n        model=\"default\",\n        use_enhanced=True,\n    )\n\n    operation = client.long_running_recognize(config=config, audio=audio)\n\n    print(f\"Transcription job submitted. Operation name: {operation.operation.name}\")\n    return operation.operation.name\n\n",
            "filePath": "submit_transcription.py"
          },
