        "text": "**Developing Transcription Tool**\n\nI've crafted `submit_transcription.py`, leveraging Google Cloud's Speech-to-Text API. The core function is ready, incorporating `google.cloud.speech_v1p1beta1` and `speech.SpeechClient()`. I'm now focusing on integrating the `client.long_running` operation for robust asynchronous transcription, which is more recent.\n\n\n**Finalizing Functionality Build**\n\nI've completed the transcription function in `submit_transcription.py`, and have incorporated the required Google Cloud Speech-to-Text elements. I've instantiated the `speech.SpeechClient()` and implemented `client.long_running_recognize` for batch processing, adding the key model specification element. I have determined the task is now complete.\n\n\n",
